{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the symbol <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/4/49428192d366caf373c0af3c3261687f12b4c883.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" /> is read \"the absolute value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />\" and is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/2/b5205f058a0f55b22ecf025f21108e6b2ed1100c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> and is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/9/52969fdeeb90f7e24cd2a2f1a6cfe124776fee2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/2/672b20fdcbe50f275f1cb5c6e07935bf21e101ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\le 0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" /> which of the following is always true?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/f/8af23663871856ecddfea5090f8fc5e681831e0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\quad |-8|&lt;|5| \\quad \\text{(B)} \\quad |a+b|=|a-b| \\quad \\text{(C)} \\quad |4-5|&lt;5-4 \\quad \\text{(D)} \\quad |7|=|-5-2| \\quad \\text{(E)} |+a|&gt;|-a|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"803\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Examine the validity of the statements one by one. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/4/7c43070a2acf8f4e25d98e48c404d9348a26d40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" /> simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/5/775b361d200b7a94263ad842545e4e146f56cfd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8&lt;5,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"46\" height=\"16\" /> which is false. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/9/09920c3af0daa12ac2ec5174e737c31e0f8cec75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{B}$\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" /> is not true in all cases (specifically, one case where it would be true is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/2/4c28242522f23e896074dc89612847f8317911d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/2/862ace71af396840c60858c7de115d492fd4180a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=0.$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/0/aa04d7a9bcbf1fe3f2037cbc5e763c4b6d2661d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"13\" /> simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/c/dacdeb8f812279cd7684011b91965333de1ee5a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1&lt;1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" /> which is false. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/a/79a4f97ce27c2bb251b589501c8f83b8d33612b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{D}$\" width=\"12\" height=\"11\" /> simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/2/28290355bc7407de6dc73bc92f918fe87550ab9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7=7,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" /> which is true. \n</p><p>Finally, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/5/7a5bb2aa78132b4b716cfde4a9136c884d94c753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{E}$\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" /> simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/9/5099c3e70edd3104ee1c26c8f0beec4849cd12a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;a,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" /> which is false.\n</p><p>The only true statement is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89ffcce10755ed8dbf15e3da55c7521953cedc0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(D)} \\quad |7|=|-5-2|.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"175\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a>)</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_18\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 18\"> Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"40%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_20\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018041530\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 124/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 661/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 305/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3414/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.141      1 Template:Succession_box\n100.00%    7.141      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:20662:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018041530 and revision id 144618. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}